  ---

  This document provides a comprehensive, byte-level breakdown of how data (including command codes and parameters) is mapped into CAN frames. It serves as a direct implementation guide for programmers working with the CAN protocol on the
  Conductor (STM32H723) and Executor (STM32F103) nodes.

